{"asset_key":"timeline/quest_story_14107240","episode":"timeline","category":"quest_story","story_id":"14107240","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:2:1410724001:1":{"text":"이곳은 여왕님의 침전인데... 어떻게 이런 곳에 드래곤이!","source_cn":"这里怎么会有一头龙……这里可是女王的寝殿！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3554DD7BBCAC4B56","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:3:1410724001":{"text":"이곳은 여왕님의 침전인데... 어떻게 이런 곳에 드래곤이!","source_cn":"这里怎么会有一头龙……这里可是女王的寝殿！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3554DD7BBCAC4B56","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1410724002:1":{"text":"어느 여왕을 말하는 거야?","source_cn":"哪个女王？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE24B56516CCCC80E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1410724003:1":{"text":"그야 당연히 셀로클랜드의 여왕님, 나사레스지요!","source_cn":"当然是萨洛克兰的女王——奈萨雷斯！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x92B550E358DB5A3E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1410724004:1":{"text":"너희 여왕이 침전에서 드래곤을 한 마리... 기른다는 말이야?","source_cn":"你们的女王，在寝殿里，养了，一头……龙？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF26B965657A9D52F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1410724005:1":{"text":"와우, 너희 여왕은 멸종 위기종을 엄청 아끼나 보네!","source_cn":"哇哦，她真是爱惜濒危物种呢！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8E6D2FC00D51FB12","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1410724006:1":{"text":"전 지금 농담할 기분이 아닙니다!","source_cn":"我没心情和你开玩笑！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x64ABB6779D1F57DF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1410724007:1":{"text":"여왕님의 침전은 고귀한 곳이라 이곳을 드나드는 사람은 손에 꼽을 정도란 말입니다!","source_cn":"你要知道女王的寝殿尊贵无比，到访过此处的人屈指可数！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF5627AF2B3CE691D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1410724008:1":{"text":"그렇겠지. 드래곤을 기르는 취미를 너희한테 들키면 안 되잖아?","source_cn":"养龙这种爱好的确不能被你们知道。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x37FC17149A159C5C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1410724009:1":{"text":"...중요한 건 그게 아닙니다!","source_cn":"……重点不是这个！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC8F814B19AF24AA7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1410724010:1":{"text":"비록 주위에 수비병과 시종이 있긴 하지만 곰곰이 생각해 보면 장로와 일부 귀족을 제외하고는 누구도 여왕님을 직접 알현한 적이 없었습니다.","source_cn":"尽管外围有守卫和侍从，但仔细想来，除了那几位长老和部分...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7FA8918004FC8D4E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1410724011:1":{"text":"저희가 들은 변명은 여왕님께서 저희에게 생명력을 하사하기 위해 허약한 상태이시니 방해를 받고 싶지 않다는 것이었지요.","source_cn":"我们得到的说辞是，女王陛下为了赐予我们生命力，身体一直...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFFEC979359658E18","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1410724012:1":{"text":"만약... 여왕님께서 사람을 만나고 싶지 않은 것이 아니라, 만날 수 없는 상황이었다면...","source_cn":"如果……女王并非不想见人，而是不能见人呢？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9C427B985116F0D5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1410724013:1":{"text":"잠깐... 이제 알 것 같아! 인듀어, 그러니까 네 말은...","source_cn":"等等……我好像懂了！因度厄，你是说……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2148FCEEDE7CF452","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1410724014:1":{"text":"헥토르 님의 수염! 헥토르 님의 망치! 어쨌든 헥토르 님이시여! 그러니까...","source_cn":"赫托的胡子！赫托的铁锤！赫托，总之赫托在下！你是说——","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2E5A2F6459E43433","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1410724015:0":{"text":"너희 여왕이 <shk>저 드래곤</shk>이라는 거야?!","source_cn":"你们的女王，<shk>是那头龙？！</shk>","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBCD87DE4D9502021","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1410724016:0":{"text":"하지만 여왕님께서 어떻게 드래곤일 수가 있는 거죠...? 그럼 저희가 마신 에센스는 설마...","source_cn":"但女王怎么会是龙……？我们喝的龙蛋，难道是——","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC4EA3FDFB2C5BE2E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:25:1410724017:3":{"text":"그러게 내 진작에 경고하지 않았던가요...","source_cn":"我不是早就警告过你了吗……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC4356CEF39DA6939","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:26:1410724018:0":{"text":"당신이 어떻게? 어디서 나타난 거야!","source_cn":"怎么是你？你从哪里冒出来的！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x36A0BF3E37E598FD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:27:1410724019:1":{"text":"여러분은 이곳에 나타나지 말았어야 했습니다.","source_cn":"是你们不该出现在这里。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9BB61DF48E86AFF1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:28:1410724020:2":{"text":"이곳은 여왕님의 침전이니 무단으로 침입해서는 안 된다.","source_cn":"此为女王寝殿，不得擅自闯入。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE1E119F078A2BF9C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:30:1410724021:1":{"text":"퀸 성하, 튜더 장군님, 당신들은 이 모든 것을 알고도 숨기고 계셨던 겁니까?","source_cn":"奎茵冕下，都铎将军，你们早就知道这一切，却选择了隐瞒吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x27B7848FDDE25711","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:31:1410724022:0":{"text":"인듀어, 에세일의 그 어떤 백성도 여왕님을 비판할 권리가 없다. 우리는 그저 여왕님을 믿기로 선택했을 뿐이지.","source_cn":"因度厄，艾塞勒的任何生灵都无权评判女王。我们只是选择了...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2160200006F82986","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:33:1410724023:0":{"text":"페리엘을 죽인 살인마! 또 사람을 현혹하는 말도 안 되는 소리를 지껄이는군!","source_cn":"好啊！杀害斐利尔的凶手，又开始说这些蛊惑人心的疯话了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE702E42610397359","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:34:1410724024:2":{"text":"어리석은 자는 이미 올바른 길로 인도받을 가치를 상실했습니다. 튜더, 이제 위협을 제거해야 할 때가 되었군요.","source_cn":"愚昧之人已经丧失了被引入正途的价值。都铎，是时候将威胁...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3EE3199D41677EAB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"narration:38:14010724:0":{"text":"대화를 나누던 중, 퀸과 튜더가 사람들을 이끌고 우리의 앞길을 막았다.","source_cn":"你们交谈之际，奎茵和都铎带来了人马挡住了你们的去路。","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh6